id: pm-rl-d3be
title: Daily release fails lint on installed extension builds that the live suites write under .agents/pm/runtime
description: "The 2026-10-28 release run 40741370216 passed tests, then npm run lint (eslint over .) failed with 5 no-restricted-syntax errors (inline type imports) in .agents/pm/runtime/live-meta/run-*/.agents/pm/extensions/pm-rl/dist/index.d.ts, an installed extension build written by scripts/live-meta.ts. ESLint ignored only coverage, dist and node_modules. Tracker data and runtime caches are not source."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
